          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most warehouses, shops and very large basements, the B-Air VG-2200 is the commercial dehumidifier to buy: 130 AHAM pints from an LGR coil, 400 CFM and the widest listed temperature range here. Choose the Abestorm Hurricane 1250 for the most pints per dollar, the Hurricane 800 to save money, the Sentinel HD90 for low running costs, and the Santa Fe Advance Dry110 when one machine has to serve several rooms through ducts.
          </p>
